        "id": 1916
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-22T22:53:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Also, memcache is a only useful if the same data is access repeatedly in a given interval. i.e.token validation data is perfect for caching. If the data is access sparingly during the cache duration, memcache will not help performance.",
      "revId": "13feeb03ab9b9358e40377c4c7a6fa4a44206c33",
      "serverId": "4a232e18-c5a9-48ee-94c0-e04e7cca6543",
      "unresolved": false
